   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello Groupmates!<div><br></div><div>I am presently working on validating a scale on positive psychology with a sample size of 555. However, my data is non-normal and I intend to use LAVAAN to run CFA.After much review, satorra-bentler chi-square was deemed appropriate for my model. I have tried to run the syntax for CFA which unfortunately didn&#39;t run. I have four subdimensions each consisting of 4, 5, 6, and 7 items respectively. </div><div><br></div><div>The code followed by me:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.3\"><i>yourmodelname</i>&lt;-&#39;</div><div style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.3\">factor1=~item1.1+item1.2+item1.3</div><div style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.3\">factor2=~item2.1+item2.2+item2.3</div><div style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.3\">factor3=~item3.1+item3.2+item3.3</div><div style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.3\">g-factor=~factor1+factor2+factor3</div><div style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.3\">&#39;</div><div style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.3\">fit&lt;-cfa(model=<i>yourmodelname</i>,data=<i>yourdatatfile.csv</i>,meanstructure=TRUE,<a href=\"http://std.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://std.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792426182892000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZHqnZlS6zngi_hE9NXth2\">std.lv</a>=TRUE, estimator=&quot;MLM&quot;)</div><div style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.3\">parameterEstimates(fit,ci=FALSE,standardized=TRUE)</div><div style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.3\">summary(fit,fit.measures=TRUE)</div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.3\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.3\">Could somebody verify if this code is correctly written? Any suggestion on this issue would be of tremendous help for me.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.3\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(17,17,17);font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.3\">Thanks in advance!!</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
